<p>Haaye hayder ke janaze pe ajab manzar tha<br> betiyaan kadmo se lipti thi basad aaho buka<br> badhke shabbar ne jo chechre se kafan band kiya<br> dekhkar bhai ke chechre ko ye zainab ne kaha</p> 
<p>rukh se ek baar kafan aur hatado bhaiyya<br> mere baba ka mujhe chehra dikhado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>Aaj baba jo mere ghar se chale jaayenge<br> Phir mujhe shaame garibaan me nazar aayenge<br> itne din kaise guzarungi batado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>jaise amma ki rida me thi shafa nana ki<br> kya ye mumkin hai ke uth jaaye mere baba bhi<br> meri chadar mere baba ko udhado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>khoon baba ki jabeen se wo gira tha jis pe<br> apne baba ki nishani mai banalungi use<br> mere baba ka musalla muje laado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>kaise batlaun ye dil gham se phata jata hai<br> kya juda baap se hokar bhi jiya jaata hai<br> apni behno ko faqat itna batado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>haaye shabbir se zainab ne kaha ro rokar<br> suna lagta hai amame ke bina baba ka sar<br> sar pe baba ke amama to sajado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>Aa rahi hongi baqqaiya se sada sun ke meri<br> sar pe baba ke na pad jaaye nazar amma ki<br> zakhm amma ki nigahon se chhupado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>Gham me baba ke tadapta hai zara dekho to<br> dur baytha hai bula laao mere ghazi ko<br> paas kuch der to baba ke bithado bhaiyya</p> 
<p>Ghar se jata tha janaza jo Ali ka bahar<br> Betiyan kehti thi zeeshano raza ro rokar<br> Aakhri baar to baba se milado bhaiyya</p>